#: ../../../variable/CTEST_TIME_LIMIT.rst:2
msgid "CTEST_TIME_LIMIT"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CTEST_TIME_LIMIT.rst:4
msgid ""
"Specify the CTest ``TimeLimit`` setting in "
"a :manual:`ctest(1)` :ref:`Dashboard Client` script, or on "
"the :program:`ctest` command line via the :ctest-dashboard-option:`-D` "
"option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../variable/CTEST_TIME_LIMIT.rst:8
msgid ""
"The value is the maximum time, in seconds, allowed for the whole dashboard "
"run, measured from the start of :program:`ctest`. The :command:`ctest_build` "
"and :command:`ctest_coverage` commands do nothing if less than two minutes "
"remain.  The :command:`ctest_test` and :command:`ctest_memcheck` commands "
"limit the timeout of each test so that it ends at least two minutes before "
"the time limit."
msgstr ""
